Blog posts for this locale go here as <slug>.mdx with frontmatter:

---
title: "Post title"
description: "One-sentence summary, used on the index card and as meta description."
date: 2026-08-05
---

Body in MDX. src/lib/blog.ts picks the file up automatically — no code change
needed. Locales are independent: a post can exist in en without forcing a
translation into fr or ar.
